  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroecological production and crop processing in the Andean Cochabamba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will take place in the Andean area of Cochabamba, where communities and families have been severely impacted by drought and changing weather conditions. The project aims to strengthen the productive system of the most vulnerable families and communities in order to enhance their resilience in the face of climate change. The project will support the implementation of vegetable plots in schools and families to improve food security and agroecological practices. It will also work closely with families in order to improve and diversify their production, providing advice of water management.</narrative>
  </description>
